:PATH
Section 1 Repeal and Amendment of Current Legislation
|

:INFO
Art. 136 Repeal of current legislation
The following Ordinances are repealed:
1. CO2 Crediting Ordinance of 22 June 2005;
2. CO2 Ordinance of 8 June 2007;
3. DETEC Ordinance of 27 September 2007 on the National Emissions Trading Registry;
4. CO2 Offsetting Ordinance of 24 November 2010;
5. Ordinance of 16 December 2011 on the Reduction of Carbon Emissions from Passenger Cars.
|

:NOTE
let. 1 — [AS 2005 3581; 2007 2915 Art. 33; 2012 1195]
